msgid "Message more than one user"
msgstr "Envoyez un message à plusieurs utilisateurs"

#: views/options.php:460
msgid "%n is replaced by number visitors"
msgstr "%n est remplacé par le nombre de visiteurs"

#: views/options.php:470
msgid "Message only one user"
msgstr "Envoyer un message à un seul utilisateur"

#: views/options.php:480
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Sauvegarder"

#: views/options.php:488
msgid "Do you want to receive the latest?"
msgstr "Voulez-vous recevoir les dernières nouveautés ?"

#: views/options.php:489
msgid ""
"Thank you very much for using our plugin, if you want to receive the latest "
"news, offers, promotions, discounts, etc ... Sign up for our newsletter. :)"
msgstr ""
"Merci beaucoup d'utiliser notre plugin, si vous souhaitez recevoir les "
"dernières nouveautés, offres, promotions, réductions, etc... Inscrivez-vous "
"à notre newsletter. :)"

#: views/options.php:494
msgid "Required"
msgstr "Requis"

#: views/options.php:499
msgid "Submit"
msgstr "Soumettre"

#: views/options.php:499
msgid "Processing"
msgstr "Traitement"

#: views/options.php:505
msgid "Need style?"
msgstr "Besoin de style ?"

#: views/options.php:506
msgid "Enjoy! Paste this CSS code into your Customizer and edit as you like"
msgstr ""
"Apprécier! Collez ce code CSS dans votre Customizer et modifiez-le comme "
"vous le souhaitez"

#: views/stats.php:277
msgid ""
"Real statistics are only stored when Fake Mode is disabled. Use this panel "
"to identify products with the most traffic and recurring interest."
msgstr ""
"Les vraies statistiques ne sont stockées que lorsque le mode Fake est "
"désactivé. Utilisez ce panneau pour identifier les produits avec le plus de "
"trafic et d'intérêt récurrent."

#: views/stats.php:278
#, php-format
msgid "Statistics retention: %d days. Older visits are deleted automatically."
msgstr ""
"Conservation des statistiques : %d jours. Les visites plus anciennes sont "
"automatiquement supprimées."

#: views/stats.php:279
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Archived page views: %s. Daily totals are kept after individual visits are "
